{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You were hired to find the fortune hidden by powerful tycoon Augustus Blackrock, but... is that all he has hidden?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582030/extras/PuzzleGif.gif?t=1742211243\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have to observe and use reason to solve the first escape room of the eight that the full game will feature. Clues and hints are everywhere - keep an eye open!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FIND KEY OBJECTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582030/extras/Object.gif?t=1742211243\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some puzzles need a key piece to work, some times you will have to look for them - sometimes you will have to solve another puzzle to find them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>INVESTIGATE THE FAMILY TRAGEDY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582030/extras/Basement.gif?t=1742211243\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You were hired by a relative of Augustus Blackrock, whose fortune hasn't been found after more than a century since his demise. Your job is to find his fortune in his puzzle ridden mansion, but that might not be his only secret...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you will try to solve the puzzles of 1 of the 8 rooms that the full game features. Will you succeed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One of the eight escape rooms featured in the final game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylized environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An intriguing story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"In a hurry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3582030/27bfe7e46f8a865a9cdb3f8b1ad6c50ad5e37500.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582030?t=1742211243","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582030?t=1742211243","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582030/53f28007835b9bd66b242d2f6b49d84d78bedfc0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742211243","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582030/53f28007835b9bd66b242d2f6b49d84d78bedfc0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742211243","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You were hired to find the fortune hidden by powerful tycoon Augustus Blackrock, but... is that all he has hidden?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582030/extras/PuzzleGif.gif?t=1742211243\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have to observe and use reason to solve the first escape room of the eight that the full game will feature. Clues and hints are everywhere - keep an eye open!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FIND KEY OBJECTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582030/extras/Object.gif?t=1742211243\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some puzzles need a key piece to work, some times you will have to look for them - sometimes you will have to solve another puzzle to find them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>INVESTIGATE THE FAMILY TRAGEDY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582030/extras/Basement.gif?t=1742211243\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You were hired by a relative of Augustus Blackrock, whose fortune hasn't been found after more than a century since his demise. Your job is to find his fortune in his puzzle ridden mansion, but that might not be his only secret...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you will try to solve the puzzles of 1 of the 8 rooms that the full game features. Will you succeed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One of the eight escape rooms featured in the final game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylized environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An intriguing story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Biri Biri"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3517980","name":"Secrets of Blackrock Manor - Escape Room"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582030/96232217e1629533f3af19f081a38c52604ec7e5/header.jpg?t=1742211243","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"2025 Juan Luis Urbano Garc\u00eda","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<stron